      "description": "Kings Chat is built on one idea: conversations should disappear once they've served their purpose.\n\nHOW IT WORKS\nThere are no usernames, phone numbers, or public profiles. To start a conversation, two people meet in person and scan each other's QR code. That's the only way to connect.\n\nONE-TIME MESSAGES\nEvery message can only be viewed once. The moment it's opened, it's permanently deleted from our servers, and the connection automatically rotates to a new private address.\n\nNOTHING LEFT BEHIND\nThere's no message history, no chat log, no record of what was said. Once a conversation ends, there's nothing left to find.\n\nYOUR OWN PASSCODE\nSet a passcode to keep the app locked when you're not using it. It's stored only on your device.\n\nKings Chat isn't for browsing, following, or building a profile. It's for saying something once, to someone you just met, and knowing it won't linger.",
